  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Mix the black beans, scallions, cilantro, lime juice, olive oil, salt, pepper, and jamaican seasoning in a bowl.",
    "Place a ssam-wrap in the cazuela and fill with the black bean mixture.",
    "Fold the ssam-wrap to enclose the filling and bake for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Repeat with the remaining ssam-wraps and filling.",
    "Let it cool for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Serve with your favorite toppings or sides."
